@startuml
!include comun.iuml
title Diagrama de componentes de Donna
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55

package "Cliente web (navegador)" {
  [Captura de audio\n(MediaRecorder API)] as MIC
  [Interfaz de usuario] as UI <<en desarrollo>>
  [Avatar 3D\n(Three.js)] as AV <<en desarrollo>>
}

package "Backend (FastAPI + Uvicorn)" {
  () "POST /api/ask" as IASK
  () "GET /audio/{archivo}" as IAUDIO
  () "GET /api/history" as IHIST
  [API REST\n(main.py)] as API
  [SpeechToText] as STT
  [Commands] as CMD
  [TextToSpeech] as TTS
  [LipSync] as LS
  [History\n(historial)] as HIST
}

package "Bibliotecas locales" {
  [faster-whisper\n(Whisper base)] as FW
  [Piper\n(es_AR-daniela-high)] as PIPER
  [OpenFaceFX] as OFX
  database "SQLite\n(donna.db)" as DB
}

cloud "Servicios externos" {
  [Wikipedia API] as WIKI <<planificado>>
  [Yahoo Finance] as YF <<planificado>>
}

MIC -right-> UI : grabación
UI -right-> AV : visemas
UI ..> IASK : <<use>>\npregunta
UI ..> IAUDIO : <<use>>\nrespuesta
IASK -down- API
IAUDIO -down- API
IHIST -down- API

API --> STT : transcribe()
API --> CMD : execute()
API --> TTS : synthesize()
API --> LS : visemes()
API --> HIST : add()

STT ..> FW
TTS ..> PIPER
LS ..> OFX
HIST --> DB
CMD ..> WIKI
CMD ..> YF
@enduml
